  "bodyHash": "734e64282cbf62ef",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>動作輔助</h1>\n<p>一款 Minecraft 模組，提供瞄準輔助<strong>且不會帶來不公平的 PvP 優勢（未來也不會有此變更）</strong>。專為動作障礙玩家打造。也適合不習慣使用電腦的新手玩家。非常適合拿來帶父母入門 Minecraft！它也能讓控制器操作更加順手（若有任何問題，歡迎告知我）。</p>\n<p>Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/yxMhpgUGjf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/yxMhpgUGjf</a></p>\n<h2>相容於任何控制器模組</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontrolify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isXander/Controlify/multiversion/dev/assets/controlify-banner.png\" alt=\"drawing\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontrollerx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gUv10ywC/7a91ed408610d97a6f57856560c8b43864b209ca_96.webp\" alt=\"drawing\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontrollermod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/2emUKbOT/a199482afed6d918472c312710d5ca6ecdcae1b0_96.webp\" alt=\"drawing\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmidnightcontrols\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/bXX9h73M/icon.svg\" alt=\"drawing\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdacontrols\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W1D3UXEc/icon.png\" alt=\"drawing\"></a></p>\n<p><em>如果您在使用上述任一控制器模組時遇到問題，請發訊息給我。我會以 Controlify 作為主要測試對象。</em></p>\n<h2>示範</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/lilmods/motor-assistance/blob/main/.github/assets/motorassistance-fighting.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"戰鬥輔助\"> <em>戰鬥輔助（<strong>對其他玩家無效</strong>）</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/lilmods/motor-assistance/blob/main/.github/assets/motorassistance-mining.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"採礦輔助\"> <em>採礦輔助</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p>![動作輔助設定](<a href=\"https://github.com/lilmods/motor-assistance/blob/main/.github/assets/motorassistance-config.png?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/lilmods/motor-assistance/blob/main/.github/assets/motorassistance-config.png?raw=true</a> ) <em>設定畫面</em></p>",
